1. Qxd5 Qxd5 2. Bh6+ Ke7 3. Rxd5 { FAIL: 1.Bh6+ Ke7 2.Rxd5 Rxe2+ 3.Qxe2 leaves the R@d5 without a defender. You must take with the queen first. I saw the discovery, but order matters. Always try to reorder your combinations.

